    card title "Whose is it?"

A: How do you ask whose something is in Russian, and answer Ivan's, or mum's?
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

A: Tom is at Masha's, and he finds a book.
    draw p_book

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Чья means whose: чья э́то кни́га? Whose book is this?
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part чья

B: Ива́н is my brother, and his name takes lesson twenty-eight's of-ending: Ива́н, Ива́на.
    highlight talk_2_words effect underline color #8f887c part Ива́на

A: So the owner comes after the thing: кни́га Ива́на, the book of Ivan.
    highlight talk_2_words effect underline color #8f887c part "кни́га Ива́на"

    erase talk p_book

    draw p_cat

    draw talkc

    draw talkc

A: Not чья now, but чей: кот is a he-word, and whose changes with it.
    highlight talkc_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part чей

B: Твой means your, to someone you call ты: твой, твоя́, твоё, with the endings of мой, моя́, моё.
    highlight talkc_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part Твой

    erase talkc p_cat

    draw p_books

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: For many books, it's чьи.
    highlight talk2_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part чьи

B: And ма́ма swaps its а for ы, as in нет воды́: кни́ги ма́мы, mum's books.
    highlight talk2_2_words effect underline color #8f887c part ма́мы

    erase talk2 p_books

    hide speakers

A: Whose works just like my: lesson eight's мой, моя́, моё, and lesson eleven's мои́ for many.
    draw hb_my m1 m2 m3 m4

B: Beside them, whose: чей, чья, чьё, чьи, with the very same last letters.
    draw hb_wh c1 c2 c3 c4

    draw k_masha k_cat parallel true

    quiz "This cat is Masha's, and Masha is a she. Which whose? ___ э́то кот?" store chk reveal.text "Чей э́то кот?" reveal.at.x 790 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a
        right: Чей: кот is a he-word, and whose follows the cat, not Masha.
        wrong: Who decides here: Masha, or the cat?
        + Чей
        * Чья

    erase k_masha k_cat question_1_stamp

A: Each takes its form from the thing: чей кот, чья кни́га, чьё окно́, чьи кни́ги.
    draw hb_th t1w t1i t2w t2i t3w t3i t4w t4i

A: So it's the thing that counts, never the owner: Ivan's cat, mum's cat or Masha's, кот is чей.
    highlight c1 t1w effect underline color #8f887c

    erase boardB

A: Now the answer: the thing first, then the owner in the of-ending: кот бра́та, the brother's cat.
    draw hc_ow hc_ph o1i o1 p1

B: Ма́ма and па́па both end in а, so both swap it for ы: кни́га ма́мы, дом па́пы.
    draw o2i o2 p2 o3i o3 p3

A: And the sister's window is окно́ сестры́.
    draw o4i o4 p4

B: But after ш, Russian writes и, as in the plurals: Ма́ша, кот Ма́ши, my cat.
    draw o5i o5 p5

B: Careful: ма́мы can also mean mums. After a thing, it means mum's.
    draw mums

    erase mums

    hide boardC

    icon q1i size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 520 or ["framed picture"] icon_look picture of window

    quiz "Ask whose window it is: ___ э́то окно́? Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Чьё э́то окно́?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 310 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Чьё: окно́ is an оно́ word, so whose ends in ё, like моё.
        wrong: Look at the thing: окно́ ends in о.
        * Чей
        * Чья
        + Чьё

    erase q1i question_2_stamp

    icon q2a size 150 set twemoji x 410 y 520 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon q2b size 130 set twemoji x 590 y 520 or ["green book","book"] icon_look picture of "closed book"
    parallel true

    quiz "Mum's book: кни́га ___. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "кни́га ма́мы" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 310 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Ма́мы: the owner takes the of-ending, а swapped for ы.
        wrong: The owner takes the of-ending: ма́ма becomes ма́мы.
        * ма́ма
        * ма́му
        + ма́мы

    erase q2a q2b question_3_stamp

    icon q3a size 150 set twemoji x 410 y 520 or ["man"] icon_look picture of boy
    icon q3b size 130 set twemoji x 590 y 520 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    parallel true

    ask "It's the brother's cat. Type the missing word: Э́то кот ___." answer ["брата"] reveal.text "кот бра́та" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 310 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Бра́та: a he-word in a consonant adds а.
        wrong: Start from брат, and add the of-ending.

    erase q3a q3b question_4_stamp

    icon q4i size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 520 or ["green book","book"] icon_look picture of "closed book"

    quiz "Tom points at a book: is it yours, Masha? Э́то ___ кни́га?" reveal.text "твоя́ кни́га" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 310 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Твоя́: кни́га is a she-word, so yours ends in я, like моя́.
        wrong: Which ending does моя́ кни́га have?
        * твой
        + твоя́
        * твоё

    erase q4i question_5_stamp

    icon q5a size 150 set twemoji x 410 y 520 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon q5b size 130 set twemoji x 590 y 520 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    parallel true

    quiz "Whose cat? Masha's: Э́то кот ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "кот Ма́ши" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 310 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ма́ши: after ш, Russian writes и, never ы, as in the plurals.
        wrong: Which letter does Russian never write after ш?
        * Ма́ша
        * Ма́шы
        + Ма́ши

    erase q5a q5b question_6_stamp

    show boardC

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    hide boardC

A: So whose copies the thing, as my does: чья кни́га?
    text e_q "Чья э́то кни́га?" say "Чья э́то кни́га?" colors {"я$":"#b5482e","а$":"#b5482e"} x 500 y 520 font_size 70

B: And the owner follows, in the of-ending: кни́га ма́мы.
    text e_a "Э́то кни́га ма́мы." say "Э́то кни́га ма́мы." say_voice b colors {"ы$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 400 font_size 70
    icon e_mum size 100 set twemoji x 430 y 250 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon e_book size 90 set twemoji x 570 y 250 or ["green book","book"] icon_look picture of "closed book"

    erase e_q e_a e_mum e_book

B: And this milk? Чьё э́то молоко́? The cat says моё! Next time, a story. Пока́!
    icon end_cat size 150 set twemoji x 400 y 470 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    icon end_milk size 130 set twemoji x 600 y 470 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk"
    text end_say "Чьё э́то молоко́?  Моё!" say "Чьё э́то молоко́? Моё!" say_voice b colors {"ё$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 300 font_size 64

